@anon.9a3c7070530f84c5ad699604f23a6f35.1928 = private unnamed_addr constant [522 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for extraneous blank line(s) after function decorators.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AThere should be no blank lines between a decorator and the object it is decorating.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Aclass User(object):\0A\0A    @property\0A\0A    def name(self):\0A        pass\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aclass User(object):\0A\0A    @property\0A    def name(self):\0A        pass\0A```\0A\0A## References\0A- [PEP 8: Blank Lines](https://peps.python.org/pep-0008/#blank-lines)\0A- [Flake 8 rule](https://www.flake8rules.com/rules/E304.html)\0A", align 1
